{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Dev Server Guide",
  "description": "Triggered manually — gives a concise step-by-step guide on how to start the POS Cloud local development environment (Vercel API server + React app)",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "userTriggered"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "Give me a short, clear guide on how to start the POS Cloud local development environment. Cover:\n\n1. Why two terminals are needed (React dev server doesn't serve the api/ folder)\n2. Terminal 1: start the Vercel API server with the exact command\n3. Terminal 2: start the React app with the exact command\n4. What URL to open in the browser\n5. One-line reminder about what vercel dev does on first run (project linking)\n6. A quick note on what breaks if you run only npm start (employee list, create employee will return empty/fail)\n\nKeep it concise — bullet points, exact commands in code blocks, no fluff."
  }
}